      "beat": "confession"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_21_v_confession_knew",
      "string_id": "13124080522047282085",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Patch",
      "text": "You knew about the couriers.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_21_v_confession_knew.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2400,
      "beat": "confession"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_21_patch_confession_knowledge",
      "string_id": "6372957177202471604",
      "speaker": "Patch",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Knew they used people. Did not know they used the people. I was told the implants carried encrypted noise, useless without a paired key.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_21_patch_confession_knowledge.wem",
      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "beat": "confession"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_21_v_confession_believed",
      "string_id": "5781486194127080472",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Patch",
      "text": "You believed that?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_21_v_confession_believed.wem",
      "duration_ms": 1800,
      "beat": "confession"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_21_patch_confession_truth",
      "string_id": "6298578629999238153",
      "speaker": "Patch",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "I believed not asking kept the route cheap and me alive. Dress it up however you want. Still the truth.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_21_patch_confession_truth.wem",
      "duration_ms": 7000,
      "beat": "confession"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_21_patch_confession_van",
      "string_id": "3374971091703359829",
      "speaker": "Patch",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "I have a van at the safe site. Registry will clear the interchange's first scan. After that, we improvise in person.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_21_patch_confession_van.wem",
      "duration_ms": 7600,
      "beat": "confession"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_23_patch_van_open",
      "string_id": "5460405368333701728",
      "speaker": "Patch",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Van belongs to a plumbing cooperative that has never fixed a pipe. Try not to add traffic violations to its business model.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_23_patch_van_open.wem",
      "duration_ms": 7600,
      "beat": "van_entry"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_23_v_runs_question",
      "string_id": "16448706511566671689",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Patch",
      "text": "How many courier runs did you touch?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_23_v_runs_question.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2800,
      "beat": "van_entry"
    },
    {
